# Semgrep ignore list (2026-09-24).
# Once this file exists Semgrep stops using its built-in defaults, so they are repeated here
# unchanged. The only additions are third-party libraries that were copied into two retired
# Lambda packages, which are not MediConnect code. The MediConnect handler files next to
# them (handler.py, diploma_scanner.py, gcp_bigquery.py, secrets_manager.py,
# lambda_function.py) are still scanned.

# Semgrep defaults
node_modules/
build/
dist/
vendor/
.env/
.venv/
.tox/
*.min.js
.npm/
.yarn/
test/
tests/
*_test.go
.semgrep
.semgrep_logs/

# Vendored third-party packages inside retired Lambda bundles (not MediConnect code)
legacy_lambdas/DoctorDiplomaScanner/*/
legacy_lambdas/DoctorDiplomaScanner/six.py
legacy_lambdas/DoctorDiplomaScanner/typing_extensions.py
legacy_lambdas/mediconnect-create-patient/*/
